2026-06-05 16:11:39,818 | AGENT | TechnicalArchitect Agent answered: To design the technical architecture for the City of Belval's intelligent assistance tool, I will leverage our company's expertise in AI/ML systems, Cloud architecture, API integration, Data engineering, and Cybersecurity. 

Firstly, we can utilize our experience with Large Language Models (LLMs) such as Mistral 7B or LLaMA 3 to develop the core AI component of the tool. These models will enable us to provide relevant answers to agents' queries. To achieve response times under 2 seconds, we can deploy these models on an inference server like vLLM or Ollama, which are part of our AI and ML stack.

For integration with existing systems of information, including business software, electronic management of documents (e.g., Alfresco, Maarch Courrier), and user directories (e.g., Active Directory/LDAP, Keycloak), we can employ API standards like REST or GraphQL. Our experience with API gateways such as Kong or Apigee will help manage these integrations securely.

